# Rank 1773 / CVE-2016-3079: Spacewalk rendered stored tag and
# system-group names into markup through raw JSP EL, so a group or
# snapshot tag whose name carried markup executed in an
# administrator's browser (cross-site scripting, CWE-79; bugzilla
# 1320452). Four sites: snapshot_tags.jsp and tags_delete.jsp render
# ${current.name} as the body of a rollback link,
# groups/delete.jsp passes ${systemgroup.name} as the arg0 of a
# bean:message, and admin/assignedgroups.jsp renders the group name
# through <c:out ... escapeXml="false"/>, which disables JSTL's
# escaping. Fix b6491eba7f wraps every interpolation in <c:out> with
# default escaping or fn:escapeXml() (and escapes the message
# parameter Java-side in DeleteGroupAction.java). The fixed revision leaves the
# ${param.sid} half of the rollback link's href raw, so that part of
# the patched line still reports on the real file; the reject block
# strips to the constructs the change changed.
#
# The raw-EL sites report under VYQL-INJ-004 through the jsp template
# profile (source analysis.template.jsp.input -> sink
# analysis.template.jsp.render). Two constructs are pinned here as
# misses: a line carrying escapeXml="false" is credited as escaped
# because the skip list matches any <c:out, and an EL wrapped in
# fn:escapeXml() still renders raw because the profile has no escape
# prefix for the jsp scope.

test "rank1773: raw el renders the tag name into the rollback link"
  lang config
  file snapshot_tags.jsp
  expect VYQL-INJ-004
  code
  ```
  <%@ taglib uri="http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/core" prefix="c" %>
  <rl:listset name="SnapshotSet">
    <rl:column headerkey="system.history.snapshot.tagName">
      <a href="/rhn/systems/details/history/snapshots/Rollback.do?sid=${param.sid}&ss_id=${current.ssId}">${current.name}</a>
    </rl:column>
  </rl:listset>
  ```

test "rank1773: raw el passes the group name to the message tag"
  lang config
  file delete.jsp
  expect VYQL-INJ-004
  code
  ```
  <%@ taglib uri="http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/core" prefix="c" %>
  <div class="page-summary">
    <p><bean:message key="systemgroup.delete.subtitle"
                  arg0="${systemgroup.name}"
                  arg1="<strong>"
                  arg2="</strong>"/></p>
  </div>
  ```

test "rank1773: c:out with escaping disabled renders the group name raw"
  lang config
  file assignedgroups.jsp
  expect VYQL-INJ-004
  code
  ```
  <%@ taglib uri="http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/core" prefix="c" %>
  <rl:listset name="groupSet">
    <rl:column sortable="true" headerkey="assignedgroups.jsp.group" sortattr="name">
      <c:out value="<a href=\"/rhn/groups/GroupDetail.do?sgid=${current.id}\">${current.name}</a>" escapeXml="false" />
    </rl:column>
  </rl:listset>
  ```

test "rank1773: the fixed revision escapes every interpolation"
  lang config
  file assignedgroups_fixed.jsp
  reject VYQL-INJ-004
  code
  ```
  <%@ taglib uri="http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/core" prefix="c" %>
  <%@ taglib uri="http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/functions" prefix="fn" %>
  <rl:listset name="groupSet">
    <rl:column sortable="true" headerkey="assignedgroups.jsp.group" sortattr="name">
      <a href="/rhn/groups/GroupDetail.do?sgid=${current.id}">
        <c:out value="${current.name}" />
      </a>
    </rl:column>
  </rl:listset>
  <p><bean:message key="systemgroup.delete.subtitle"
                arg0="${fn:escapeXml(systemgroup.name)}"
                arg1="<strong>"
                arg2="</strong>"/></p>
  ```
